  {
    "uuid": "77be07f6-3dd1-5af6-bdcf-acda8a1c858b",
    "entry": "続投",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "ぞくとう",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞",
        "動詞-サ変",
        "動詞-自動詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "continuing to pitch",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "エースピッチャーは、連投の疲れも見せず、今日もマウンドで続投した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "監督は、彼の安定した投球を見て、最後まで続投させることを決めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "チームが劣勢の状況でも、彼はひたむきに続投し、味方を鼓舞した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "米国空軍の爆撃隊が、その得意とする爆弾の連続投下を決行したのだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "空襲下の日本",
                "author": "海野十三",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "staying at one's post",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "社長は、会社の厳しい状況にもかかわらず、続投の意向を示した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "長年の経験を買われ、彼はそのプロジェクトのリーダーに続投することになった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "前任者の急な辞任により、彼は会長の座に続投せざるを得なかった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
